# Deploy on finish

When a task that changes the site is complete (and the user did not ask to keep it local-only), deploy to production without waiting to be asked again.

```bash
npx vercel --prod --yes --scope administracao-8824s-projects
```

- Project: `lecobiaggioni` (already linked in `.vercel/`)
- Public URL: https://lecobiaggioni.vercel.app
- Always pass `--scope administracao-8824s-projects` — deploying without it fails with "Not authorized"
- After deploy, give the production URL
